   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>本艦は<im(2)>これより東アジアに針路を取り、\n当該海域展開中の#c[5E8FD8]ＵＣＥ#c所属艦\n#c[E2E258]ノヴィス・ノア#cと合同で奪還作戦を行う。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>We will<im(2)> now set course for East Asia\nto join the #c[5E8FD8]UCE#c ship #c[E2E258]Novis Noah#c in those\nwaters for a joint recovery operation.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
