    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>#c[5E8FD8]ノヴィス・ノア#cはオーガニック・エンジン\nという新型エンジンを搭載した実験艦だ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>The #c[5E8FD8]Novis Noah#c is an experimental ship\nequipped with a new type of engine called\nan Organic Engine.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63002#10",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>近年、地球全土で多発する地殻変動の\n影響で、深海より発見された遺跡…\nオルファンのことを知ってるかな？",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>Are you familiar with Orphan... the ruins\ndiscovered in the deep sea after recent\ntectonic activity across the globe?",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63002#11",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
