    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>彼らは現在も#c[BE5050]リクレイマー#cの監視任務を\n続行中だが、その任務を一時中断して\n#c[BE5050]２号機#cの追跡に協力してもらっている。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>They are still monitoring the #c[BE5050]Reclaimers#c,\nbut they paused that mission to help us\npursue #c[BE5050]Unit 2#c.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63002#13",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
