   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>詳しい状況は#c[5E8FD8]ノヴィス・ノア#cの艦長代理から\n説明がある。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>The acting captain of the #c[5E8FD8]Novis Noah#c\nwill explain the situation in detail.",
   "notes": ""
  },
