    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(31,1)><sp(2)>行方不明になった前艦長に代わって、\n#c[5E8FD8]ノヴィス・ノア#cの指揮をとっています。\nよろしくお願いします。",
   "en": "<op(31,1)><sp(2)>With our former captain missing,\nI have taken command of the #c[5E8FD8]Novis Noah#c.\nI look forward to working with you.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63002#17",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 31,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(31,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "<im(7)>",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(31,1)><sp(2)>緊急事態なので、あいさつはこのくらいで。\n現在、本艦は#c[BE5050]リクレイマー#cの#c[BE5050]グランチャー\n部隊<im(7)>#cに襲撃を受けて、応戦中です。",
   "en": "<op(31,1)><sp(2)>Given the emergency, pardon the brevity.\nWe are under attack by a #c[BE5050]Reclaimer#c\n#c[BE5050]Grand Cher unit<im(7)>#c and returning fire.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63002#18",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 31,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(31,1)>",
