   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(31,1)><sp(2)>目標を追跡中のところ、\nオーガニック・プレートを回収にきた\n#c[BE5050]リクレイマー#cと遭遇した形です。",
   "en": "<op(31,1)><sp(2)>While pursuing our target, we ran into\n#c[BE5050]Reclaimers#c who had arrived to\nretrieve Organic Plates.",
   "notes": ""
  },
