   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#6",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>こちらはアルビオン。\n君がノヴィス・ノアのパイロットだな？<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>This is the Albion.\nYou're the Novis Noah's pilot, right?<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Albion comms operator."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#7",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>ああ、このブレンパワードのパイロット、\n伊佐未　勇だ。<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Yeah. I'm Yuu Isami, pilot of\nthis Brain Powerd.<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Yuu Isami responds."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#8",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>今から君を援護する。<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>We'll back you up now.<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Albion pilot."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#9",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(700)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>すまない！\nよし、気合入れていくぞ、ブレン！<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Thanks!\nAll right, let's do this, Brain!<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Yuu Isami speaks to his Brain."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#10",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>あれがブレンパワード……\n初めて見たけど、ほんとに生物みたいね。<ab(400)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>First time seeing a Brain Powerd...\nIt really looks like a living thing.<ab(400)>",
   "notes": "Female observer (Linda Plato or operator)."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#11",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(0)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>自己修復機能があるとか、\nオーガニック・プレートから生まれるとかって<ab(0)>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Self-repair capabilities, born\nfrom Organic Plates...<ab(0)>",
   "notes": "Continuation of speech from row 36."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#12",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>ほんとなのかしら……<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>I wonder if it's all true...<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Conclusion of speech from rows 36-37."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#13",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>別働隊から連絡がありました。\n目標の輸送船団はもぬけの殻だそうです。<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Report from the detached force.\nThe target transport convoy was empty.<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Communications operator."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#14",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(100)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>どうやらまた外れか……<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Looks like another bust...<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Pilot."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#15",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>というよりは、一杯食わされたな。<ab(200)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>More like we've been had.<ab(200)>",
   "notes": "Tak or Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#16",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>そいつらは、俺たちをリクレイマーに\nぶつけるための囮だよ。<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>They were decoys to throw us at\nthe Reclaimers.<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Continuation of row 41."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#17",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>気に病んでもしょうがあるまい。\n今は目の前の任務を優先する。<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>No use brooding over it.\nPrioritize the mission before us.<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Senior officer (Amuro or Sinapus)."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#18",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>近接攻撃の後、追い討ちを使えば、\n敵の体勢を崩すことができる。<ab(400)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Follow up after a melee attack\nto break the enemy's stance.<ab(400)>",
   "notes": "Tactical instruction."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#19",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>その隙にたたみ掛けろ！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Now strike while they're open!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Continuation of row 44."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#20",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(100)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>今だ！　攻撃を叩き込め！<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Now! Hammer them with attacks!<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Combat order."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#21",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>敵は距離をとるタイプ…\n射撃戦が有効か？<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>The enemy keeps their distance...\nIs ranged combat more effective?<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tactical assessment."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#22",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>勇！　オルファンの裏切り者！\n黙って私に討たれなさい！<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Yuu! Traitor to Orphan!\nShut up and let me strike you down!<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Quincy Issa."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6031#23",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 1,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>この感触！　姉さんか！？<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>This feeling! Sis?!<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Yuu Isami recognizes Quincy."
